VoltFlow - IEC 61850 GOOSE configuration validator

Backend (from the root directory):
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000

Frontend:
cd voltflow-ui
npm install
npm run dev

The frontend calls http://localhost:8000 by default. To use another backend URL,
copy voltflow-ui/.env.example to voltflow-ui/.env.local and set VITE_API_URL.

Tests (from the root directory):
python -m pytest

Frontend checks:
cd voltflow-ui
npm run lint
npm run build

The local database (voltflow.db) is rebuilt automatically when its schema changes;
re-upload your SCL files afterwards.
